{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想知道今個週期還剩多少流動數據，又不想登入電訊商帳戶？《Data Widget》在裝置上直接統計流動數據用量，適合關注用量、害怕超額收費的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂週期緊貼賬單用量</h2>\n<p>Data Widget 在裝置上統計流動數據用量，與自訂上限比對，可選每月、每週或自訂週期，未用完的數據可累積至下一週期。主畫面顯示剩餘用量，進度條同時反映時間與用量，箭頭代表日曆進度，綠色為未超前，紅色為消耗較快。鎖定畫面、StandBy 及 Apple Watch 錶面均可查看，亦可設定 80% 或 90% 提示。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-86-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Data Widget: remaining data</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T06:00:29.365923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}